  "description": "Buff, broad, and BIG. Despite looking like a hot hunk, Danny’s always too busy dealing with poverty to enjoy life. He has to be content with a place to sleep, just enough money to get by, and frequent visits to the gym. It looks like things won’t change until one day…a mysterious (cute) girl approaches him with a confusing message. Danny has some work to do, a work of a physical kind. But, hey. Who said that all physical labor has to be tiring…? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\nNote: *side story A (GL) is 24 chapters long, while side story B (BL) is 30 chapters long.*",
